<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh July trade deficit at $159.36 million.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh July trade deficit at $159.36 million.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's trade deficit narrowed to $159.36 million in July from $303 million in June and $207.5 million in July 1995, central bank officials said.</p>
<p>(in million U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>			  JULY	JUNE     JULY 95</p>
<p>    Exports	   355.64    379.0    307.75</p>
<p>    Imports	   515.O     682.0    515.25</p>
